        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;" value="Metadata Collection → SPDX 2.3 JSON → Visualization" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="600" x="400" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ds-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;rounded=1;" value="Data Sources (collected by sidecar)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="300" x="40" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ds1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="bomsh_create_bom_java.py&#xa;(Bytecode SourceFile Analysis)&#xa;&#xa;Input: target/classes/**/*.class&#xa;&#xa;For each .class file:&#xa;  1. Read .class binary (CAFEBABE magic)&#xa;  2. Parse constant pool entries&#xa;  3. Find SourceFile attribute&#xa;  4. Map class → source via path similarity&#xa;&#xa;Output: OmniBOR treedb&#xa;  JAR → class → source.java&#xa;  (SHA-256 hashes for provenance)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="300" x="40" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ds2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="mvn dependency:tree -DoutputType=dot&#xa;(Maven Dependency Graph)&#xa;&#xa;Input: pom.xml&#xa;&#xa;DOT output parsed to extract:&#xa;  • groupId:artifactId:version&#xa;  • scope (compile, runtime, test, provided)&#xa;  • direct vs transitive&#xa;  • dependency hierarchy&#xa;&#xa;Output: List of DependencyNode objects&#xa;  {group, artifact, version, scope, children}" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="300" x="40" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ds3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="Build Tool Detection&#xa;(subprocess version queries)&#xa;&#xa;javac -version → &quot;javac 21.0.x&quot;&#xa;mvn --version → &quot;Apache Maven 3.9.x&quot;&#xa;&#xa;Output: Tool name + version" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="300" x="40" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gen-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" value="SPDX Generator (java_generator.py)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="320" x="440" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gen" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="JavaSpdxGenerator&#xa;&#xa;1. Create document metadata&#xa;   • SPDXVersion: SPDX-2.3&#xa;   • namespace: https://omnibor.io/...&#xa;   • creators: [Tool: omnibor-analysis]&#xa;&#xa;2. Create root package&#xa;   • name: omnibor-java-testapp&#xa;   • version: 1.0.0&#xa;   • downloadLocation: git+https://...&#xa;   • primaryPackagePurpose: APPLICATION&#xa;   • PURL: pkg:maven/com.example/testapp@1.0.0&#xa;&#xa;3. Add dependency packages (from dep:tree)&#xa;   • jsoup → DEPENDS_ON root&#xa;   • log4j-core → DEPENDS_ON root&#xa;   • log4j-api → DEPENDS_ON log4j-core&#xa;   • bcprov → DEPENDS_ON root&#xa;   Each with: version, PURL, supplier, scope&#xa;&#xa;4. Add build tools (BUILD_TOOL_OF root)&#xa;   • javac 21.x&#xa;   • maven 3.9.x&#xa;&#xa;5. Emit DESCRIBES relationship&#xa;&#xa;6. Generate HTML visualizations&#xa;   • D3.js force-graph per SBOM&#xa;   • Interactive: zoom, drag, search" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="460" width="320" x="440" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eds1" edge="1" parent="1" source="ds1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=2;fontSize=9;" target="gen" value="treedb">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eds2" edge="1" parent="1" source="ds2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=2;fontSize=9;" target="gen" value="dep graph">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eds3" edge="1" parent="1" source="ds3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=2;fontSize=9;" target="gen" value="tool versions">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="out-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;rounded=1;" value="Output SBOMs + Visualizations" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="180" x="860" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="build-sbom" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="testapp_build.spdx.json&#xa;(CISA Build SBOM)&#xa;&#xa;Contains:&#xa;• Root package (APPLICATION)&#xa;• All compile-scope deps (LIBRARY)&#xa;• Build tools: javac, maven&#xa;&#xa;Relationships:&#xa;• DESCRIBES (doc → root)&#xa;• DEPENDS_ON (root → dep)&#xa;• DEPENDS_ON (dep → transitive)&#xa;• BUILD_TOOL_OF (tool → root)&#xa;&#xa;Use case: build provenance,&#xa;supply chain audit" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="260" x="860" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="analyzed-sbom" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="testapp_analyzed.spdx.json&#xa;(CISA Analyzed SBOM)&#xa;&#xa;Contains:&#xa;• Root package (APPLICATION)&#xa;• All compile-scope deps (LIBRARY)&#xa;• NO build tools&#xa;&#xa;Relationships:&#xa;• DESCRIBES (doc → root)&#xa;• DEPENDS_ON (root → dep)&#xa;• DEPENDS_ON (dep → transitive)&#xa;&#xa;Use case: vulnerability scanning,&#xa;license compliance" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="260" x="860" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
