        <mxCell id="golden" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;dashed=1;" value="Golden File Comparison&#xa;&#xa;CI SPDX compared against&#xa;tests/golden/spdx/java/testapp/&#xa;in omnibor-analysis repo.&#xa;&#xa;SpdxStructuralComparator checks:&#xa;• Package count (old → new)&#xa;• Relationship types match&#xa;• Version strings present&#xa;• PURL format correct&#xa;• No unexpected additions/removals" vertex="1">
